OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy start with coastal
OL,6,Fmist and isolated showers. A band of
OL,7,Fpersistent, potentially heavy rain
OL,8,Fmoves northwards during the early
OL,9,Fafternoon, with a risk of thunder and
OL,10,Fhail. Staying warm and humid through
OL,11,Fthe day.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA wet evening to come with
OL,14,Fsome further heavy rain and
OL,15,Fthunderstorms. Further outbreaks of
OL,16,Frain likely overnight, although
OL,17,Fsouthern areas turning drier for a
OL,18,Ftime.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
