OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FSome early brightness in the
OL,6,Fsouth, otherwise a rather cloudy day
OL,7,Fwith further rain at times. The rain
OL,8,Fpotentially turning heavier and more
OL,9,Fpersistent for a time.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FAn
OL,12,Funsettled bank holiday weekend with
OL,13,Fshowers and possibly more thunder on
OL,14,Fthe way. Staying warm to start with
OL,15,Fbut turning fresher as winds shift to
OL,16,Fa westerly by Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
